+```text
+intFloatDiv, divII, floatMod, floatLt, absF,
+floorFI, toF, ceilF,
+subF, divF, addF, mulF, powF, gtF, eqF,
+decStrToF, divFloatIntV, intToF, truncF, roundF, roundFN, sqrtF,
+sortVS, sortKeyVS, md5hexCodes
