+|---|---|
+| `compare-gt` | exit 0, `#Top` |
+| `compare-mod-zero` with `F > 1` | exit 0, `#Top` |
+| `assign-floor` with `F > 1` | exit 0, `#Top` |
+| `augassign-one` | exit 0, `#Top` |
+| `return-factor` with arbitrary callee suffix | exit 0, `#Top` |
+
+See
